build/
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.a
*.h
# Root-only (the stray `go build ./cmd/tui` artefact). Anchored with a
# leading slash so the cmd/tui source directory isn't excluded.
/tui

# VSCode "Local History" extension artefacts.
.history/

# TUI account preset file. Ignored everywhere because it typically
# holds real credentials. The one under test-server/ is committed as a
# reference — it only references the dummy docker creds.
.env.yaml
!test-server/.env.yaml

# Build output. `chore archives` writes the c-archives and their generated
# headers here for a consumer to copy out of (`chore artifact` prints this
# directory). build/ above is `chore tui`'s.
/dist/

# chore fingerprint cache (sources:/generates: checksums). Derived data.
.chore/

# C ABI harness build output
/build/cabi/
/build/cabi-cover/
